      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Doesn't flattening 64 maps scatter the information again?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Doesn't flattening 64 maps scatter the information again?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zVTDuRiEINZyyBYppe3mX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2566.512422885273,
      "y": 9140.758557949088,
      "width": 686.8510303808893,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641462950,
      "version": 704,
      "versionNonce": 304185347,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the convolutional layers, the network finds features and their locations—like asking,\n“Where is the eye?” The 2D grid matters here.\n\nAfter flattening, the feature maps become abstract signals—like “pointy ear” or “furry\ntexture” detected. Now the network shifts to reasoning with those features, not\nfinding them.\n\nThe exact location matters less than just knowing the feature is there.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the convolutional layers, the network finds features and their locations—like asking, “Where is the eye?” The 2D grid matters here.\n\nAfter flattening, the feature maps become abstract signals—like “pointy ear” or “furry texture” detected. Now the network shifts to reasoning with those features, not finding them.\n\nThe exact location matters less than just knowing the feature is there.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
