      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ReLu activation function\n- Feature maps are. passed through an activation function. ReLu is just one of them.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ReLu activation function\n- Feature maps are. passed through an activation function. ReLu is just one of them.\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3LmbxN7OWzXWbJQwm4p4x",
