      "width": 811.0655369991023,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1986938982,
      "version": 1171,
      "versionNonce": 714860515,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pooling\n- The purpose of convolutional layers is to extract features. Convolutional layers\ncreate multiple feature maps, but this can be a lot of data. The vectors become\nhuge, and we have to introduce a lot more features / neurons into the subsequent\nlayers.\n\nMore neurons with the same amount of data = Prone to overfitting\n\n- Pooling's main job is to shrink the feature maps. This makes the network faster\nand more robust by summarizing the most important information in a region.\n\nMax pooling is one option:\n- You define a window size (same concept as with a sliding kernel)\n- You keep the single largest value, and discard the rest\n- E.g. a 3x3 window size below",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pooling\n- The purpose of convolutional layers is to extract features. Convolutional layers create multiple feature maps, but this can be a lot of data. The vectors become huge, and we have to introduce a lot more features / neurons into the subsequent layers.\n\nMore neurons with the same amount of data = Prone to overfitting\n\n- Pooling's main job is to shrink the feature maps. This makes the network faster and more robust by summarizing the most important information in a region.\n\nMax pooling is one option:\n- You define a window size (same concept as with a sliding kernel)\n- You keep the single largest value, and discard the rest\n- E.g. a 3x3 window size below",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
