    {
      "id": "taafNteWUIWknL0s4z_9-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2598.6215930981043,
      "y": 14624.937811642538,
      "width": 681.4794921875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c001",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1013762662,
      "version": 75,
      "versionNonce": 2078825955,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Batch norm is put right after the convolutional layer in the sequence.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Batch norm is put right after the convolutional layer in the sequence.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7kubfFT5jYW_HMes_mcrt",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -3980.7209090417223,
      "y": 819.0577891157847,
      "width": 602.0231116077873,
      "height": 163.76065889598775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c004",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 526528550,
      "version": 271,
      "versionNonce": 1539253709,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yInnSooMaDwafkhFWQLV8"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "yInnSooMaDwafkhFWQLV8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3970.6991603667348,
      "y": 838.4381185637785,
      "width": 581.9796142578125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c005",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1105315814,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 529049987,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A neuron is a tiny calculator. It takes several numbers as\ninput, multiplies each input by a 'weight' (its importance),\nadds a bias value (adjustment / offset), and finally, passes\nthis result through an activation function to produce one\nsingle output",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "7kubfFT5jYW_HMes_mcrt",
      "originalText": "A neuron is a tiny calculator. It takes several numbers as input, multiplies each input by a 'weight' (its importance), adds a bias value (adjustment / offset), and finally, passes this result through an activation function to produce one single output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YwpB4QgYHCO3H3DsC4qAM",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -4392.192708410279,
      "y": 2347.0941245761887,
      "width": 602.0231116077873,
      "height": 138.72940889598777,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c006",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 24406202,
      "version": 1029,
      "versionNonce": 2043864109,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UkOkoorDNKKvVKh1awwJJ"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "UkOkoorDNKKvVKh1awwJJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4382.940918231386,
      "y": 2366.4588290241827,
      "width": 583.51953125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c007",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 253444474,
      "version": 1013,
      "versionNonce": 1818132771,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A single neuron is simple, but a layer combines many neurons,\neach with its own weights. They all get the same input but\nproduce different outputs—letting the layer detect many\npatterns at once.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "YwpB4QgYHCO3H3DsC4qAM",
      "originalText": "A single neuron is simple, but a layer combines many neurons, each with its own weights. They all get the same input but produce different outputs—letting the layer detect many patterns at once.",
