    {
      "id": "Cl4zYWJHm97KfPWV70ok-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4752.849252372022,
      "y": 4882.165423991656,
      "width": 731.2506103515625,
      "height": 74.3924989749812,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c01w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 826607014,
      "version": 2645,
      "versionNonce": 2048111789,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Run sample through network with the forward pass\n- Compare the networks prediction with the real label, and calculate a loss. \n(Number representing how good/bad the network is at predicting)",
      "fontSize": 19.837999726661653,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Run sample through network with the forward pass\n- Compare the networks prediction with the real label, and calculate a loss. \n(Number representing how good/bad the network is at predicting)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j_miP6QaKWeHmW9O3um-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4753.989582849005,
      "y": 4986.850048468429,
      "width": 1042.52197265625,
      "height": 74.3924989749812,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c01x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 992043238,
      "version": 3124,
      "versionNonce": 699463843,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. An optimizer determines how weight and bias values should be changed, to improve the loss\n- Calculate partial derivatives for all weights and biases (back propagation)\n- Learning rate is how big of a change is made to weights and biases at a time (overshoot/speed tradeoff)",
      "fontSize": 19.837999726661653,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. An optimizer determines how weight and bias values should be changed, to improve the loss\n- Calculate partial derivatives for all weights and biases (back propagation)\n- Learning rate is how big of a change is made to weights and biases at a time (overshoot/speed tradeoff)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
