      "versionNonce": 1309898413,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flatten to\nprepare for the\nfully connected\nlayer",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flatten to prepare for the fully connected layer",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Yom0xbwOkh9cjaCtxKLs6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8895.73545531926,
      "y": 3406.8161347080577,
      "width": 133.3596314796887,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c09t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1582725862,
      "version": 4416,
      "versionNonce": 1745245859,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The layer's job\nis to take the\n4x8 spatial grid\nfor each of the\n512 channels and\naverage it down\nto a single 1x1\nvalue. That will\nsummarize the\nspatial\ninformation for\neach feature\nchannel.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The layer's job is to take the 4x8 spatial grid for each of the 512 channels and average it down to a single 1x1 value. That will summarize the spatial information for each feature channel.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "82GvtRRLc6vzvLiAkqvQY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8595.029050519497,
      "y": 3456.736323921393,
      "width": 133.3596314796887,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c09u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 710088614,
      "version": 4517,
      "versionNonce": 1126832397,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Extracts the\nfinal and most\ncomplex feature\nrepresentations\nbefore the\nclassification\nstage",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Extracts the final and most complex feature representations before the classification stage",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NEM1OHFsvTXW0vbnC1NhR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8253.154911204336,
      "y": 3453.1674947285146,
      "width": 133.3596314796887,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c09v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1674156474,
      "version": 4519,
      "versionNonce": 1860799043,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Continues to\ndownsample and\nlearn even more\nabstract\nfeatures from\nthe previous\nlayer's output",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Continues to downsample and learn even more abstract features from the previous layer's output",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s0fifxAnDP5QFQ93ThxLK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7901.149715802774,
      "y": 3448.656605853189,
      "width": 133.3596314796887,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c09w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 691911398,
      "version": 4547,
      "versionNonce": 1979543405,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reduces spatial\ndimensions while\nincreasing the\nnumber of\nfeature channels\nto capture more\nintricate\npatterns",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reduces spatial dimensions while increasing the number of feature channels to capture more intricate patterns",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "o4lmHXvjyrXRamALNdCTx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7325.047215118528,
      "y": 3443.0153221453957,
      "width": 269.0101717923563,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c09x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 779763450,
      "version": 4698,
      "versionNonce": 107301347,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deepens the network to learn\nmore complex features without\nchanging dimensions",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deepens the network to learn more complex features without changing dimensions",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
