    {
      "id": "KVBPLGmWh0mleWuFMiWkj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6935.127721062636,
      "y": 2260.100238506818,
      "width": 1106.7946959773822,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 649830950,
      "version": 878,
      "versionNonce": 100681507,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785642146339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example\n\nThe input to a block (x) has a certain feature.\n\nThe ideal output for the network requires that feature to be stronger.\n\nWithout a shortcut: The block would have to learn the entire stronger feature from scratch.\n\nWith a shortcut: The block only has to learn the small difference F(x) - x needed to make the feature stronger.\nThe original feature is \"passed through the shortcut\" and the small modification is added to it.\n\nIt is much easier for a network to learn a small correction than it is to re-learn an entire complex feature that\nwas already mostly correct.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example\n\nThe input to a block (x) has a certain feature.\n\nThe ideal output for the network requires that feature to be stronger.\n\nWithout a shortcut: The block would have to learn the entire stronger feature from scratch.\n\nWith a shortcut: The block only has to learn the small difference F(x) - x needed to make the feature stronger. The original feature is \"passed through the shortcut\" and the small modification is added to it.\n\nIt is much easier for a network to learn a small correction than it is to re-learn an entire complex feature that was already mostly correct.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "leFVJ7u2iDJ_Vth50ypwn",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 6905.969532439403,
      "y": 2235.5285302253205,
      "width": 1176.0793074296826,
      "height": 371.99454292582334,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Ae",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
