      "text": "50 classes, meaning 50 options to pick between.\n\nRandom guessing would therefore have a 2% accuracy.\n\nOur model accuracy: around 86%.\n\nImprovement: 86 / 2 = 43 fold improvement - GREAT!",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "50 classes, meaning 50 options to pick between.\n\nRandom guessing would therefore have a 2% accuracy.\n\nOur model accuracy: around 86%.\n\nImprovement: 86 / 2 = 43 fold improvement - GREAT!",
